```

> **Tip:**  
> `soundfile` is a small dependency that lets us read wav data.  
> If you prefer not to use it, just stream the file straight to `openai.audio.transcriptions.create()` (the current SDK can accept a file‑like object).

---

## 2️⃣ Frontend – `static/index.html`

```html
