 *  -------------------------------------------------
 *  Author:   <your name>
 *  License:  MIT (or any permissive license)
 *
 *  Compile with:
 *     gcc -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -std=c11 -fsanitize=address -o todo todo.c
 *
 *  Notes on security:
 *   • All input is read with fgets() into bounded buffers.
 *   • Task strings are limited to MAX_TASK_LEN bytes.
