/*
 *  Secure & Corrected Program to Find the Longest Consecutive Subsequence
 *
 *  Author: [Your Name]
 *  Date: 2026-01-31
 *
 *  This program reads an integer n followed by n integers.
 *  It prints the longest run of consecutive integers that appear
 *  in the input set, sorted ascendingly.
