|------|----------------|
| TLS handshake success | Verify server cert chain, protocol version. |
| Authentication enforcement | Attempt connection without login; ensure failure. |
| Message integrity | Tamper with packet; confirm server rejects. |
| File upload limits | Upload oversized file; expect error. |
