### 代码完整示例（结合安全与自动刷新）

```java
public class NacosYamlUpdater {

    private final ConfigService service;
    private final Yaml yaml;
    private volatile Map<String, Object> currentConfig;

    public NacosYamlUpdater(String dataId, String group, Properties nacosProps) throws Exception {
        this.service = NacosFactory.createConfigService(nacosProps);
        this.yaml = new Yaml(new SafeConstructor());

        // 初始化读取
        loadConfig(dataId, group);

        // 监听配置变更
        this.service.addListener(dataId, group, new Listener() {
            @Override public void receiveConfigInfo(String configInfo) { loadConfig(dataId, group); }
            @Override public Executor getExecutor() { return null; } // 默认线程池
        });
    }

    private synchronized void loadConfig(String dataId, String group) {
        try {
            String raw = service.getConfig(dataId, group, 5000);
            if (raw != null) {
                currentConfig = yaml.load(raw);
                System.out.println("配置已刷新");
            }
        } catch (Exception e) { e.printStackTrace(); }
    }

    public synchronized Object get(String keyPath) {
        // keyPath: "crawler.threadPool.size"
        String[] parts = keyPath.split("\\.");
        Map<String, Object> node = currentConfig;
        for (int i = 0; i < parts.length - 1; i++) {
            node = (Map<String, Object>) node.get(parts[i]);
            if (node == null) return null;
        }
        return node.get(parts[parts.length - 1]);
    }

    public synchronized void set(String keyPath, Object value) throws Exception {
        String[] parts = keyPath.split("\\.");
        Map<String, Object> node = currentConfig;
        for (int i = 0; i < parts.length - 1; i++) {
            node = (Map<String, Object>) node.get(parts[i]);
            if (node == null) throw new IllegalArgumentException("路径不存在");
        }
        node.put(parts[parts.length - 1], value);

        String newYaml = yaml.dump(currentConfig);
        // 发布
        if (!service.publishConfig(dataId, group, newYaml)) {
            throw new RuntimeException("发布失败");
        }
    }
}
```

> 只要把 `NacosYamlUpdater` 注入到业务层，配置修改就像操作普通 `Map` 一样方便。  
> 并且因为你使用了 `SafeConstructor` + `publishConfig` 的返回值，安全性得到保证。

