| **No authentication** | The server does not present a certificate (the client will not verify any server cert). | `SSL_VERIFY_NONE`. |
| **3DES encryption** | Use a cipher suite with Triple‑DES. | `3DES` is available. |
| **SHA‑512 message digest** | The MAC/ signature uses SHA‑512. | Not normally available in the “official” suites; we’ll use a custom one. |

