### 5.2 记录文件读写

```java
package com.ecom.chat.model;

import java.io.*;
import java.nio.file.*;
import java.util.*;
import com.google.gson.*;

public class ChatHistory {
    private static final String HISTORY_DIR = "chat_records";
    private final Path recordFile;
    private final Gson gson = new GsonBuilder().create();

    public ChatHistory() {
        String userId = System.getProperty("user.id", "default");
        recordFile = Paths.get(HISTORY_DIR, userId + ".json");
        try { Files.createDirectories(recordFile.getParent()); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
    }

    public List<ChatRecord> load() {
        if (!Files.exists(recordFile)) return new ArrayList<>();
        try (BufferedReader br = Files.newBufferedReader(recordFile)) {
            JsonArray arr = JsonParser.parseReader(br).getAsJsonArray();
            List<ChatRecord> list = new ArrayList<>();
            for (JsonElement e : arr) {
                Message msg = gson.fromJson(e, Message.class);
                list.add(new ChatRecord(msg));
            }
            return list;
        } catch (IOException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
            return new ArrayList<>();
        }
    }

    public void add(ChatRecord record) {
        List<ChatRecord> current = load();
        current.add(record);
        try (BufferedWriter bw = Files.newBufferedWriter(recordFile,
                StandardOpenOption.CREATE, StandardOpenOption.TRUNCATE_EXISTING)) {
            gson.toJson(current, bw);
        } catch (IOException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
    }
}
```

> **安全注意**  
> 1. 记录文件放在服务器安全目录，设置权限只对服务器进程可写。  
> 2. 使用加密（如 AES）对文件内容进行加密，防止日志泄漏。  
> 3. 防止日志被恶意写入：对 `Message` 的 `content` 做长度限制。

