## 综合代码示例（简化版）

```java
public class SecureVideoServer {

    private final int port = 8443;
    private final String keystorePath = "/etc/ssl/keystore.jks";
    private final String truststorePath = "/etc/ssl/truststore.jks";

    public void start() throws Exception {
        SSLContext sslContext = createSSLContext();
        SSLServerSocketFactory ssf = sslContext.getServerSocketFactory();
        try (SSLServerSocket ss = (SSLServerSocket) ssf.createServerSocket(port)) {
            ss.setNeedClientAuth(true);
            System.out.println("Secure video server listening on port " + port);

            while (true) {
                SSLSocket socket = (SSLSocket) ss.accept();
                new Thread(new ClientHandler(socket)).start();
            }
        }
    }

    private SSLContext createSSLContext() throws Exception {
        KeyStore ks = KeyStore.getInstance("JKS");
        ks.load(new FileInputStream(keystorePath), "keystorePass".toCharArray());

        KeyStore ts = KeyStore.getInstance("JKS");
        ts.load(new FileInputStream(truststorePath), "truststorePass".toCharArray());

        KeyManagerFactory kmf = KeyManagerFactory.getInstance(KeyManagerFactory.getDefaultAlgorithm());
        kmf.init(ks, "keyPass".toCharArray());

        TrustManagerFactory tmf = TrustManagerFactory.getInstance(TrustManagerFactory.getDefaultAlgorithm());
        tmf.init(ts);

        SSLContext ctx = SSLContext.getInstance("TLSv1.3");
        ctx.init(kmf.getKeyManagers(), tmf.getTrustManagers(), null);
        return ctx;
    }

    private static class ClientHandler implements Runnable {
        private final SSLSocket socket;
        private final RateLimiter limiter = RateLimiter.create(30); // 30 fps

        ClientHandler(SSLSocket socket) {
            this.socket = socket;
        }

        @Override
        public void run() {
            try (socket) {
                InputStream in = socket.getInputStream();
                // 这里假设你已经有一个帧解析器（自定义或基于 OpenCV）
                FrameParser parser = new FrameParser(in);
                // FFmpegRecorder 示例：仅演示设置
                try (FFmpegFrameRecorder recorder = new FFmpegFrameRecorder(
                        "/tmp/out.mp4",
                        640, 480)) {
                    recorder.setFrameRate(30);
                    recorder.start();

                    while (parser.hasNext()) {
                        if (!limiter.tryAcquire(1, TimeUnit.SECONDS)) {
                            // 超速，丢弃帧
                            continue;
                        }
                        Frame frame = parser.next();
                        // 你可以在这里做内容检查、脱敏、日志等
                        recorder.record(frame);
                    }
                    recorder.stop();
                }
            } catch (Exception e) {
                e.printStackTrace(); // 或使用安全日志
            }
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        new SecureVideoServer().start();
    }
}
```

> **注意**  
> 1. 上面演示只做了最基本的 TLS + 帧速率限制。  
> 2. 根据业务需求，你可能还需要：  
>    - 客户端身份校验（JWT、OAuth 等）。  
>    - 流内容加密（前端压缩后再加密）。  
>    - 监控（Prometheus、ELK）。  

