## 2. Project Skeleton

```
└─ src
   └─ main
      ├─ java
      │   └─ com.mycorp.fiskal
      │       ├─ FiscalService.java          // Core logic
      │       ├─ CertManager.java            // PKCS#12 loader
      │       ├─ SignatureUtil.java          // XML/JSON signing
      │       └─ HttpClientUtil.java         // HTTPS wrapper
      └─ resources
          ├─ fiskal.keystore.p12
          └─ logback.xml
```

Use **Maven** or **Gradle** for dependency management.  
Key libraries (all available in Maven Central):

| Library | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `javax.xml.crypto.dsig` (built‑in) | XML Digital Signature API |
| `org.bouncycastle:bcpkix-jdk15on` | PKCS#12 parsing, SHA‑256, RSA |
