2. **Start the server**

   ```bash
   java -cp .;path\to\jackson-core.jar;path\to\jackson-databind.jar Server
   ```

3. **Start two clients** (in separate terminals or by double‑clicking the JAR)

   ```bash
   java -cp .;path\to\jackson-core.jar;path\to\jackson-databind.jar Client
   ```

4. **Play**  
   *Both clients will show “X” or “O” on connect.*  
   Click a square to place your symbol. The other client will update automatically.

