| **Lack of logging / audit** | Hard to investigate abuse | Log connections, disconnects, and message counts. |
| **No rate‑limiting** | Malicious clients can flood the server | Keep a per‑client counter and drop or throttle if too many messages per second. |
| **No input sanitisation** | Potential injection if you extend the protocol | Validate or escape any user‑supplied data before storing or displaying. |

