    throw new BaseException("Uploaded file too large");
}

// during extraction – keep a running total
long extracted = 0;
...
extracted += len;
if (extracted > MAX_EXTRACTED_BYTES) {
    throw new BaseException("Archive too large after extraction");
}
```

Also consider:

- Rejecting archives with *excessive* nesting depth (e.g. >10 levels).
- Rejecting archives where the *total* number of entries > 10,000.

