| Before | After | Why |
|--------|-------|-----|
| `@Value` on a `static` field | `@Value` on a *non‑static* field | Spring can only inject into instance fields. |
| `reactiveRedisTemplate` method annotated with `@Bean` inside the filter | removed – the bean is now created in a dedicated `@Configuration` class | Keep configuration separate from the filter logic. |
| Minor style fixes (e.g. `Optional` usage) | – | – |

