## 3. Going deeper (optional)

If you need the *exact* DH parameters (prime size, generator, etc.) you can use **BouncyCastle**:

```java
import org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider.asymmetric.ec.BCECPublicKey;
import java.security.interfaces.ECPublicKey;

public static int getECDHKeySize(SSLSession session) {
    try {
        java.security.cert.X509Certificate cert =
                (java.security.cert.X509Certificate) session.getPeerCertificates()[0];
        java.security.PublicKey pub = cert.getPublicKey();
        if (pub instanceof ECPublicKey) {
            return ((ECPublicKey) pub).getParams().getCurve().getFieldSize();
        }
    } catch (Exception e) { /* ignore */ }
    return -1;
}
```

