| **Resource leakage** | Prevent memory leaks | All streams closed in `finally` / try‑with‑resources. |
| **User authentication** | Prevent impersonation | Not implemented in demo; recommend adding a login screen and verifying a password or certificate before accepting. |
| **Directory traversal** | Prevent reading arbitrary files | `ChatHistory` uses a sanitized filename (`replaceAll`). |
| **Large payload protection** | Prevent OOM / DoS | Add size limits when decoding Base64 (e.g., reject > 10 MB). |

