### 2‑2. `Message.java`（协议头 + 体）

```java
package com.ecomm.chat;

import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;
import java.util.Arrays;

public class Message {
    public MessageType type;
    public String header;   // 例如：<filename>:<size> 或 <username>
    public byte[] body;     // 若为文本则为 UTF‑8 字节；文件/图片为原始字节

    public static Message readFrom(InputStream in) throws IOException {
        // 1. 先读 4 字节长度
        byte[] lenBytes = new byte[4];
        if (in.read(lenBytes) != 4) throw new EOFException();
        int len = java.nio.ByteBuffer.wrap(lenBytes).getInt();
        // 2. 读 len 字节
        byte[] msgBytes = new byte[len];
        int read = 0;
        while (read < len) {
            int n = in.read(msgBytes, read, len - read);
            if (n <= 0) throw new EOFException();
            read += n;
        }
        // 3. 解析
        String meta = new String(msgBytes, 0, msgBytes.indexOf(0), StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
        byte[] body = Arrays.copyOfRange(msgBytes, msgBytes.indexOf(0) + 1, msgBytes.length);
        Message m = new Message();
        String[] parts = meta.split(":", 2);
        m.type = MessageType.valueOf(parts[0]);
        m.header = parts.length > 1 ? parts[1] : "";
        m.body = body;
        return m;
    }

    public void writeTo(OutputStream out) throws IOException {
        // 序列化：TYPE:header\0<body>
        byte[] meta = (type.name() + ":" + header).getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
        byte[] msg = new byte[meta.length + 1 + body.length];
        System.arraycopy(meta, 0, msg, 0, meta.length);
        msg[meta.length] = 0; // 0 作为分隔符
        System.arraycopy(body, 0, msg, meta.length + 1, body.length);
        // 写长度
        out.write(java.nio.ByteBuffer.allocate(4).putInt(msg.length).array());
        out.write(msg);
        out.flush();
    }
}
```

> *说明*  
> - 使用 4 字节整型存储消息长度，保证消息完整。  
> - 通过 `\0` 分隔元数据与正文，避免正文中出现冒号导致解析错误。  

