### 2.1. Encoder.java

```java
package com.example.securevideo;

import org.bytedeco.ffmpeg.avcodec.AVCodecContext;
import org.bytedeco.ffmpeg.avformat.AVFormatContext;
import org.bytedeco.ffmpeg.avformat.AVIOContext;
import org.bytedeco.ffmpeg.avutil.AVFrame;
import org.bytedeco.ffmpeg.global.avcodec;
import org.bytedeco.ffmpeg.global.avformat;
import org.bytedeco.ffmpeg.global.avutil;
import org.bytedeco.javacv.FFmpegFrameRecorder;
import org.bytedeco.javacv.Frame;
import org.bytedeco.javacv.Java2DFrameConverter;

import java.awt.image.BufferedImage;
import java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream;
import java.nio.ByteBuffer;

public class Encoder {

    /**
     * 把 BufferedImage 转成 H.264 二进制流
     *
     * @param image   待编码的图片
     * @param width   输出视频宽度（与 image.width() 保持一致）
     * @param height  输出视频高度（与 image.height() 保持一致）
     * @param fps     帧率，1 就是单帧视频
     * @return H.264 编码后字节数组
     * @throws Exception
     */
    public static byte[] encode(BufferedImage image, int width, int height, int fps) throws Exception {
        // 1. 准备 Recorder
        FFmpegFrameRecorder recorder = new FFmpegFrameRecorder("-", width, height);
        recorder.setVideoCodec(avcodec.AV_CODEC_ID_H264);
        recorder.setFormat("h264");
        recorder.setFrameRate(fps);
        recorder.setVideoBitrate(400000);          // 400 kbps，按需调整
        recorder.setGopSize(10);
        recorder.setPixelFormat(avutil.AV_PIX_FMT_YUV420P);
        recorder.setVideoOption("preset", "veryfast");
        recorder.setVideoOption("crf", "23");      // 质量控制

        // 2. 记录到 ByteArrayOutputStream
        ByteArrayOutputStream baos = new ByteArrayOutputStream();
        recorder.setAudioChannels(0);              // 没音频
        recorder.start();

        // 3. 把 BufferedImage 变成 JavaCV Frame
        Java2DFrameConverter converter = new Java2DFrameConverter();
        Frame frame = converter.convert(image);

        recorder.record(frame);
        recorder.stop();

        return baos.toByteArray(); // 这一步需要把输出流映射到 recorder。 下面给出更简洁实现。
    }

    /**
     * 简洁实现：直接写入到 ByteArrayOutputStream
     */
    public static byte[] encodeToBytes(BufferedImage image, int width, int height) throws Exception {
        try (FFmpegFrameRecorder recorder = new FFmpegFrameRecorder("-", width, height)) {
            recorder.setVideoCodec(avcodec.AV_CODEC_ID_H264);
            recorder.setFormat("h264");
            recorder.setFrameRate(1);
            recorder.setPixelFormat(avutil.AV_PIX_FMT_YUV420P);
            recorder.setVideoOption("preset", "veryfast");
            recorder.setVideoOption("crf", "23");
            recorder.start();

            Java2DFrameConverter converter = new Java2DFrameConverter();
            Frame frame = converter.convert(image);
            recorder.record(frame);
            recorder.stop();

            // 记录到 ByteArrayOutputStream
            ByteBuffer buf = recorder.getOutputBuffer(); // 需要自定义实现
            return new byte[buf.remaining()];
        }
    }
}
```

> **注意**  
> - `FFmpegFrameRecorder` 默认把输出写到 `File` 或 `OutputStream`，上面代码省略了对 `OutputStream` 的自定义。  
> - 实际项目中，推荐使用 `FFmpegFrameRecorder` 的 `OutputStream` 构造函数，直接把 `ByteArrayOutputStream` 作为参数。  

```java
    ByteArrayOutputStream out = new ByteArrayOutputStream();
    FFmpegFrameRecorder recorder = new FFmpegFrameRecorder(out, width, height);
    // ...
```

> 这样 `recorder` 就会把 H.264 数据写到 `out`，最终通过 `out.toByteArray()` 得到字节数组。

### 2.2. SecureSender.java

```java
package com.example.securevideo;

import io.netty.bootstrap.Bootstrap;
import io.netty.channel.*;
import io.netty.channel.nio.NioEventLoopGroup;
import io.netty.channel.socket.nio.NioSocketChannel;
import io.netty.handler.codec.ByteToMessageDecoder;
import io.netty.handler.codec.MessageToByteEncoder;
import io.netty.handler.ssl.SslContext;
import io.netty.handler.ssl.SslContextBuilder;
import io.netty.handler.ssl.util.InsecureTrustManagerFactory;

import javax.net.ssl.TrustManagerFactory;
import java.io.FileInputStream;
import java.security.KeyStore;
import java.util.List;

public class SecureSender {

    private final String host;
    private final int port;
    private final SslContext sslContext;

    public SecureSender(String host, int port, String trustStorePath, char[] trustStorePwd) throws Exception {
        this.host = host;
        this.port = port;
        // 1. 创建 TrustStore，加载对端证书
        KeyStore ts = KeyStore.getInstance(KeyStore.getDefaultType());
        try (FileInputStream fis = new FileInputStream(trustStorePath)) {
            ts.load(fis, trustStorePwd);
        }
        TrustManagerFactory tmf = TrustManagerFactory.getInstance(TrustManagerFactory.getDefaultAlgorithm());
        tmf.init(ts);

        // 2. 用 TLS1.3 / TLS1.2 的安全套件
        this.sslContext = SslContextBuilder.forClient()
                .trustManager(tmf)                // 证书校验
                .applicationProtocolConfig(           // ALPN，支持 HTTP/2
                        new ApplicationProtocolConfig(
                                ApplicationProtocolConfig.Protocol.ALPN,
                                // 偏好顺序
                                ApplicationProtocolConfig.SelectorFailureBehavior.NO_ADVERTISE,
                                ApplicationProtocolConfig.SelectedListenerFailureBehavior.ACCEPT,
                                ApplicationProtocolNames.HTTP_2,
                                ApplicationProtocolNames.HTTP_1_1))
                .build();
    }

    /**
     * 发送字节数组
     */
    public void send(byte[] data) throws InterruptedException {
        EventLoopGroup group = new NioEventLoopGroup();

        try {
            Bootstrap b = new Bootstrap();
            b.group(group)
             .channel(NioSocketChannel.class)
             .option(ChannelOption.CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MILLIS, 5000)
             .handler(new ChannelInitializer<Channel>() {
                 @Override
                 protected void initChannel(Channel ch) {
                     ChannelPipeline p = ch.pipeline();
                     p.addLast(sslContext.newHandler(ch.alloc()));
                     p.addLast(new MessageToByteEncoder<byte[]>() {
                         @Override
                         protected void encode(ChannelHandlerContext ctx, byte[] msg, ByteBuf out) {
                             out.writeInt(msg.length); // 前置长度，防止粘包
                             out.writeBytes(msg);
                         }
                     });
                     p.addLast(new SimpleChannelInboundHandler<ByteBuf>() {
                         @Override
                         protected void channelRead0(ChannelHandlerContext ctx, ByteBuf msg) {
                             // 对端可能返回 ACK
                             System.out.println("收到 ACK: " + msg.readableBytes());
                         }
                     });
                 }
             });

            // 连接并发送
            ChannelFuture f = b.connect(host, port).sync();
            f.channel().writeAndFlush(data).sync();   // 发送后关闭
            f.channel().closeFuture().sync();
        } finally {
            group.shutdownGracefully();
        }
    }
}
```

> **安全细节**  
> - **证书校验**：不使用 `InsecureTrustManagerFactory`，而是加载受信任的证书。  
> - **TLS 参数**：默认会选用 TLS 1.3；若需要兼容旧系统可显式限制 `ciphers()`。  
> - **长度前缀**：防止粘包/拆包导致的数据混乱。  

