| **Audit log** | Persist each vote with timestamp and client IP (append-only log). | For forensic analysis. |
| **Input sanitization** | The server already checks that `vote N` is an integer and within bounds. | Prevents crashes and injection. |
| **Server hardening** | Run under a dedicated user, limit open file descriptors, use firewall to expose only port 5000. | Hardens the OS surface. |

