javac DataService.java Client.java
java Client
```

After the client starts, click **“Run Non‑Threaded”** and then **“Run Multi‑Threaded”**. The results (including the elapsed time for each version) will appear in the text area. You can copy the two times and calculate the speed‑up:

```
Speed‑up (ms) = Non‑threaded time – Multi‑threaded time
```

