Below is a **concept‑level** walk‑through that shows how to build a *very basic* VPN‑like tunnel in pure C# (no NuGet packages, only the .NET runtime).  
It is **not** a production‑grade VPN – it demonstrates the core ideas and gives you a skeleton you can extend.  

> **Caveats / Safety**  
> * The sample uses **raw sockets** (Windows requires admin privileges).  
> * It runs only on Windows (Linux raw‑socket handling differs).  
> * It does **no encryption/authentication** – you must add that for real use.  
> * Modifying routing tables and intercepting all traffic is privileged; the code below will require Administrator rights.  

