## 9. Things to Watch Out For

| Issue | Mitigation |
|-------|------------|
| **Nashorn deprecated** | Works fine on Java 8 which is what Forge 1.8.9 uses. |
| **Security** | Nashorn runs with the same permissions as the JVM. Don’t expose it to untrusted code. |
