| 4 | **CSRF/Replay** | Not relevant here because the app only reads data, but if you add user‑generated content later, consider CSRF tokens. | Use same‑site cookies or tokens for write operations. |
| 5 | **Error handling** | Unhandled errors reveal stack traces or raw API error responses. | Catch and display a user‑friendly message; never expose raw error payloads. |

