> **NOTE** – The algorithm is intentionally simple and works well for clear, rhythmic audio (e.g., a metronome or a drum loop).  It’s not a full‑blown beat‑tracking engine but will give you a good live BPM readout for most use‑cases.

---

## 1️⃣ index.js – Node.js Server

