- `dotenv` – loads env vars from `.env`  
- `cors` – configures Cross‑Origin Resource Sharing  
- `bcryptjs` – password hashing  
- `jsonwebtoken` – JWT creation & verification  
- `pg` – PostgreSQL client (or `mysql2`, `mssql`, etc.)

