## 5.  A quick note on “security” for the rest of the function

| Issue | What the code currently does | Suggested improvement |
|-------|------------------------------|------------------------|
| **Endpoint hard‑coding** | `http://localhost:8000/...` | Use a config/ENV variable. |
| **No authentication** | Not shown here | Add an `Authorization` header if your API requires it. |
| **Error handling** | Console logs only | Consider user‑friendly UI feedback or retry logic. |
| **`Promise.all` vs `Promise.allSettled`** | If one tagger fails, the whole loop stops | `Promise.allSettled` can let the others succeed while still reporting failures. |
| **Potential race** | None (sequential `await` inside loop) | Keep the sequential nature if you want deterministic ordering; otherwise you could run all images in parallel (with care). |

