> *Express/EJS* gives you pure server‑side rendering.  
> *PostgreSQL LISTEN/NOTIFY* is the standard way to react to DB changes without polling.  
> *Socket.io* gives a simple WebSocket abstraction that falls back to HTTP long‑polling if needed.  
