## 2. `package.json`

```json
{
  "name": "flight-display",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "SSR flight board with real‑time updates",
  "main": "server.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node server.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "ejs": "^3.1.9",
    "express": "^4.18.2",
