> **Security highlights**  
> * All DB queries are parameterised (even though no user input).  
> * EJS automatically escapes interpolated data → no XSS.  
> * Socket.io is configured with CORS and can be upgraded to WSS.  
> * The only data exposed to the client is the flight list, no auth tokens or sensitive metadata.

