If you *really* need to pass data to the endpoint, the two standard ways are:

| Verb | Body support | Typical use case |
|------|--------------|------------------|
| **POST** | ✔ | Create/modify resources, send JSON, multipart/form-data, etc. |
| **GET**  | ❌ (but browsers allow it) | Retrieve resources, optionally filter via query string |

