   * The GCD is shown.  
   * If `gcd == 1`, the modular inverse of `a` modulo `b` is displayed together with its value reduced to the range `[0, b‑1]`.

The page is self‑contained, uses plain HTML/CSS/JavaScript and can be opened in any modern browser.

