## 6. Graceful Shutdown & Process Lifecycle

| Issue | Why it matters | Recommendation |
|-------|----------------|----------------|
| **`lockManager.initializeTerminationHandlers()`** | We don’t see its implementation; it might not close sockets or DB. | Ensure the handlers call `server.close()` and `MongoDBService.disconnect()`. |
| **No `process.on('SIGINT')`/`SIGTERM`** | Server may stay open after a SIGTERM (e.g., during Docker shutdown). | Add listeners for graceful cleanup. |

**Suggested snippet:**
```js
