| ✅ | Item |
|----|------|
|  | Define schema with proper types (`INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT`, `UNIQUE` on username). |
|  | Use parameterized queries everywhere. |
|  | Hash passwords (`bcrypt`, `argon2`, or similar). |
|  | Validate & sanitize all user input. |
