Your `id` is `NULL` because the table definition never made it an auto‑incrementing integer and you never supplied it in the `INSERT`. Fix the schema, switch to parameterized queries, hash passwords, and tidy up the async flow, and you’ll have a functional, safer registration endpoint. Happy hacking (responsibly)!

