 * ---------------------------------------------
 * 1️⃣  Basic fetch to OpenWeatherMap
 * 2️⃣  Simple client‑side caching (localStorage)
 * 3️⃣  Graceful error handling
 * 4️⃣  Security‑researcher checklist comments
