    …
    var chosenColor = "";
    if (redRadio.checked) { chosenColor = "red"; }
    else if (blueRadio.checked) { chosenColor = "blue"; }
    …
}
```

Here `chosenColor` is a **local** variable (`var`/`let` inside the function). It lives only while `handleBetClick()` is executing; once that function returns, the variable goes out of scope.

When you click the “Start Race” button the race has already started and `animate()` is executing – but `chosenColor` is no longer available.

---

