| Approach | What you change | Why it works |
|----------|-----------------|--------------|
| **Global variable** | Declare `let chosenColor;` at the top of the script, outside any function. Inside `handleBetClick()` assign to it (`chosenColor = "red" ...`). | `animate()` can now see it because it’s in a parent scope (the module’s global scope). |
