## 15. Security Checklist

| Threat | Mitigation in this demo |
|--------|------------------------|
| **SQL injection** | PDO prepared statements everywhere |
| **Password theft** | `password_hash()`/`password_verify()` |
| **XSS** | `htmlspecialchars()` on all output |
| **CSRF** | *Not implemented in demo.*  Add a CSRF token to all POST forms and check it server‑side. |
| **Session fixation** | Session regenerated after login (`session_regenerate_id(true);`) – add that to `login.php` after successful login. |
| **Brute‑force** | Add rate‑limiting or CAPTCHA on login/register forms. |
| **Information leakage** | Error messages are generic. |
| **Access control** | Role check in admin pages, ownership check for editing posts. |
| **HTTPS** | Ensure the web server forces HTTPS. |

