Below is a **step‑by‑step guide** that shows how to build a secure login / signup flow in PHP 8+ using MySQL (or MariaDB).  
The example focuses on **security best practices** from the OWASP Top 10, and it is written so you can copy‑paste the snippets into a small, production‑ready project.

> **NOTE** – This is not a fully fledged framework, but it demonstrates all the core concepts you’ll need when you start writing your own authentication system.

