## 3.  Environment Variables

Keep credentials out of your repository:

```
# .env  (do not commit)
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_NAME=myapp
DB_USER=myapp_user
DB_PASS=verySecurePassword
```

Load them in PHP (use `vlucas/phpdotenv` if you like, otherwise a simple manual loader):

```php
<?php
