| **Session security** | Protects session hijacking. | `session_start(['cookie_httponly'=>true,'cookie_secure'=>true]);` |
| **Password reset flow** | Needs unique tokens, expiration, revocation. | Generate random token, store hash + expiry in DB. |
| **Two‑factor authentication (2FA)** | Adds an extra layer. | TOTP via `Google Authenticator`, or email/SMS codes. |
| **Logging & monitoring** | Detect anomalies. | Log failed logins, lockouts, password changes. |

