## 8.  Common Mistakes to Avoid

| Mistake | What it breaks | Fix |
|---------|----------------|-----|
| Storing passwords in plain text or reversible encryption | Immediate compromise if DB leaks | Never; use `password_hash()` |
| Concatenating SQL strings | SQL injection | PDO prepared statements |
