## 1. Database Design (MySQL – can be translated to MariaDB, PostgreSQL, SQLite, etc.)

| **Column** | **Type** | **Size** | **Constraint** | **Description** |
|------------|----------|----------|----------------|-----------------|
| `book_id` | `INT` | 11 | `PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT` | Unique book identifier (internal). |
| `code` | `VARCHAR(20)` | 20 | `NOT NULL UNIQUE` | “Mã sách” – a short alphanumeric code used by librarians. |
| `title` | `VARCHAR(255)` | 255 | `NOT NULL` | “Tên sách” – full book title. |
| `department` | `VARCHAR(100)` | 100 | `NOT NULL` | “Chuyên ngành” – academic department or subject area. |
| `author` | `VARCHAR(255)` | 255 | `NOT NULL` | “Tên tác giả” – author(s). |
| `publisher` | `VARCHAR(255)` | 255 | `NOT NULL` | “Nhà xuất bản” – publisher name. |
| `year` | `YEAR` | 4 | `NOT NULL` | “Năm xuất bản” – publication year. |
| `created_at` | `TIMESTAMP` | N/A | `DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP` | Record creation timestamp. |
| `updated_at` | `TIMESTAMP` | N/A | `DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP` | Record update timestamp. |

**SQL to create the table**

```sql
CREATE TABLE `library_books` (
    `book_id`          INT(11) UNSIGNED NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
    `code`             VARCHAR(20)  NOT NULL UNIQUE,
    `title`            VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    `department`       VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    `author`           VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    `publisher`        VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    `year`             YEAR         NOT NULL,
    `created_at`       TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    `updated_at`       TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    PRIMARY KEY (`book_id`)
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
```

